---
_meta:
  title: "OrionDB - A Vector Database Built from Scratch"
  description: "Learning project exploring vector database internals: HNSW indexing, similarity search, and storage engine design."
---

OrionDB is a vector database built from scratch as a learning project. The goal is to understand how vector databases work under the hood - storage, indexing, and similarity search.

::: note
This is a first-time database project. Expect rough edges and honest notes about what we got wrong.
:::

## Explore

- [Getting Started](01-getting-started/index) - how to run it and make your first query
- [Architecture](02-architecture/index) - design decisions and internals
- [Dev Journal](03-journal/index) - notes from building a database for the first time
